# phone: Phone page. Check in each look.
# Never pair a real phone: start pairing only to see the code, then Cancel.
ipc panels settings phone
wait 2
shot ph-top
note P1: same groups, rows, texts, footers in both shells (the arena has no phone: "No phone connected"); gaps of 24 between groups. P4: Webcam rows (not ready: "Phone camera" with Install / Set Up) same text and button; do not click Install.
ptr move 1100 600 scroll 0 5
wait 1
shot ph-scroll
note P1/P4/P5 cont.: lower groups and More options row ("Show the phone in the Dock") same as QML.
# MANUAL: P2 (needs adb and qrencode) click "Pair": label "Scan this code on your phone", a white 176 px square with a sharp black QR code (Rust must show the code, crisp modules, not blurred); click Cancel: label "Pair with a QR code", the square gone.
# MANUAL: P3 only with an unauthorised phone plugged in: "Allow this computer on your phone" in the accent colour.
# MANUAL: P5 More options: toggle "Show the phone in the Dock": config phone.dock follows.
ipc panels close
